{"id":"48b6b0dc312679c4","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-countable-borel-equivalence-relation.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive4 Countable Borel Equivalence Relation","display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-countable-borel-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Countable Borel Equivalence Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-countable-borel-equivalence-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive4-countable-borel-equivalence-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-countable-borel-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Countable Borel Equivalence Relation","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-countable-borel-equivalence-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-countable-borel-equivalence-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive4-countable-borel-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Countable Borel Equivalence Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,E,\\tau_X,\\tau_\\times \\in V\">\\(X,E,\\tau_X,\\tau_\\times \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4CountableBorelEquivalenceRelation}_S \\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4CountableBorelEquivalenceRelation}_S \\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}countable\\text{-}borel\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4CountableBorelEquivalenceRelation}_S(X,E,\\tau_X,\\tau_\\times)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\vec X,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{X\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau_X\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X\\times X,\\tau_\\times)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(E,X\\times X,\\tau_\\times)\n\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left|\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\right|\\leq\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}countable\\text{-}borel\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4CountableBorelEquivalenceRelation}_S(X,E,\\tau_X,\\tau_\\times)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\vec X,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{X\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau_X\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X\\times X,\\tau_\\times)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(E,X\\times X,\\tau_\\times)\n\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left|\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\right|\\leq\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Borel condition is evaluated in the product topology, and countability is imposed on every equivalence class.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,E,\\tau_X,\\tau_\\times \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4CountableBorelEquivalenceRelation}_S \\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}countable\\text{-}borel\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4CountableBorelEquivalenceRelation}_S(X,E,\\tau_X,\\tau_\\times)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\vec X,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{X\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau_X\\})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X\\times X,\\tau_\\times)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(E,X\\times X,\\tau_\\times)\n\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left|\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\right|\\leq\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1653,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1840","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-countable-borel-equivalence-relation.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive4-countable-borel-equivalence-relation]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["9375de7089953a2b","908bc7b079f5d25b","5260a5349d0b732f","36d7463d215be751"]}